### ========================================================
### Secure Notes REST API - Manual Testing Requests
### ========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. API Root & Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Register a New User
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 4. Login User
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### Store Token from Login Response
@authToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### 5. Get Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Change Current User Password (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "SecurePassword123!",
  "newPassword": "NewSuperSecurePassword456!"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### NOTES MANAGEMENT (CRUD)
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Create a New Note
# @name createNote
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Meeting Notes & Action Items",
  "content": "Discuss architecture of the Secure Notes REST API with JWT authorization.",
  "tags": ["work", "backend", "security"],
  "isPinned": true
}

### Store Note ID
@noteId = {{createNote.response.body.data._id}}

### 7. Get All Notes for Current User (with search and tag filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?search=security&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Get Single Note by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Update Note by ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Updated Meeting Notes & Action Items",
  "content": "Updated content: Completed implementation of authentication middleware.",
  "tags": ["work", "completed"],
  "isPinned": false
}

### 10. Delete Note by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Verify Note Deletion (Should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
